# The payload hash inventory (runtime/payload/core/manifest.json) must be
# platform-independent: its sha256 values cover the files below, so every
# checkout — Windows or POSIX, autocrlf on or off — must byte-see the same
# content. Force LF for the sync sources and their shipped copies.
core/** text eol=lf
adapters/** text eol=lf
templates/** text eol=lf
START-HERE.md text eol=lf
EXAMPLES.md text eol=lf
LEGAL-NOTICE.md text eol=lf
README.md text eol=lf
runtime/payload/** text eol=lf
